# Memory bank

**Skill:** `memory-bank` · **Architecture:** `.agent-workflow/context/memory-bank-architecture.md`

## Every conversation (first turn)

```bash
node .agent-workflow/tools/cli/memory.mjs bootstrap
```

Re-run when the active issue changes. Use `--issue` / `--client` when known.

## Log after verified milestones

```bash
node .agent-workflow/tools/cli/memory.mjs log --issue PROJ-123 --client optional \
  --symptom "..." --decision "..." --confidence verified --source qa|sql|code|pr \
  --sources "path|reference"
```

One event per milestone. `hypothesis` → `--expires` (+7d). No secrets or PII.

Before `log`, `memory.mjs query --issue PROJ-123` to skip duplicates.
